          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Maria openjo malaika ni, “Gime obedi nedi ma to an abedo nyako mambula?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To malaika waco rigo ni, “Cuny Maleŋ bino loro kwoŋin, aka meni pa Were Madwoŋ Maloyo bino umin; am'omiyo nyathi m'ibino nywolo ibino lwoŋo ni ŋataleŋ, Wod Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka pama, wat perin Elizabeth gi tiyo pere bende otieko ogamo iye nyathi majayac; aka me dwe pere mar'aucel, ŋata yado ilwoŋo ni kinywol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 18:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ri Were ongoye gima kinyalere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria owaco ni, “An abedo ŋeca pa Rwoth; weyi wotimere ran paka iwaco no.” Gikenyo malaika oweyo go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maria wendo ri Elizabeth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no Maria omako royo mayot to kidho i piny matendere tendere, yu tindi ma Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go odonjo i ot pa Zekaria to m'otho Elizabeth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo tekin Elizabeth winjo moth pa Maria, nyathi manitie i iye ogweco. Cuny Maleŋ opoŋ kwoŋ Elizabeth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to luwo gi dwonde ma malo munyo waco ni, “Ijasilwany kwoŋ mon, Nyathi m'ilanywolo bende jasilwany! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me silwany aŋo ma min Rwoth gipi obino bongan ka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole tekin awinjo moth perin to nyathi ma iyan gweco gi kisangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In ijasilwany m'iyeyo ni mikwenda pa Rwoth rin bino timere adieri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wer pa Maria ma foyo Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
